    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42186" root="وفض" body-key="w">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوفض</span></b> : see 1, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, <i>He
made</i> a she-camel <i>to go the pace termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَب</span>;
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوضف</span>. (Khaleefeh El-Hoseynee.) And
<i>He dispersed</i> camels. (The same, and K.) See also
10. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوفض لَهُ</span> <i>He spread for him a carpet,</i> or
<i>the like, by which to preserve himself from the
ground;</i> (K, TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوضم</span>. (TA)

